{
  "name": "edit_experiment",
  "description": "Change one actual experiment peak-profile selection or exclusion-row operation through the original app methods. Use current experiment/region IDs. Profile tokens must be offered for that exact experiment beam mode. Append keeps its ordinary generated ID/default bounds; inspect its actual returned row before bound edits. Each changed operation owns ordinary Undo; equal stored values skip setters/cues/Undo. Both modes use the same app mutation; Show actions adds only original navigation/reveal/visual cues. No automatic sorting, cropping, conversion, calibration or uncertain retry.",
